{"parse": {"title": "死生对位-05", "pageid": 134866, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%AD%BB%E7%94%9F%E5%AF%B9%E4%BD%8D-04\" title=\"死生对位-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">死生对位-05</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%AD%BB%E7%94%9F%E5%AF%B9%E4%BD%8D-06\" title=\"死生对位-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">死生对位</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">05</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.BB.88.E5.B0.86.E6.B2.89.E6.B2.A1\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"终将沉没\">终将沉没</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 终将沉没</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">The Inevitable Sink</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-bangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"bangongshi\"><img alt=\"bangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-bangongshi.png/600px-Cg-bangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-bangongshi.png/900px-Cg-bangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-bangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-bangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>攀高放置监测仪的工作结束，研究员返回了临时驻点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648602.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-648602.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648602.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648602.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-648602.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648602.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/HeadIconSmall-648602.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648602.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>怎么只有你？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>蕾切尔在测温。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>如玛格丽特所料，对方向她走来，在她面前站定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>我已经解开了笔记的秘密。那本属于安妮的笔记。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>没想到这耗费了你整整一个月的时间，黑墙研究员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>你在里面发现了什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>一开始，我执着于解开笔记本里书写的方程，尝试寻找隐藏在数字背后的蛛丝马迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>我甚至去找乌尔里希组长，它怀疑这整本笔记都是一个巨大的密码组合……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>但后来，我发现了。这些方程都只是普通的推导，它们只是安妮在课堂上记下的片段知识。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>这些方程本身没什么特别的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>黑墙深吸了一口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>你看起来有很多话想说，但是不知道该怎么开口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>在我研究安妮的笔记的时候，我意识到了一些事情……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>这本笔记，它忠实地记载着安妮的学院日常。从这些算数方程中，我们能够得知她每天在上什么课，研究什么课题，它比日程表还要清晰。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>从某一个时刻开始，安妮的状态急转直下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>她的计算频频出错，课堂笔记也出现大量涂改，这证明她无法集中精神，无法专注在学习上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>直至后面，她的计算结果出了重大的纰漏，我猜测这是她的课题无法继续下去的重要原因之一。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>曾在纸页上目睹的苦难，复又从她的舌尖吐出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>在她出“意外”前的那段时间，她的状态很不对劲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>而她产生转变的那个时刻，就是十月下旬的某一天。那一天，她在笔记本里记下了你的课表。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>看起来，她打探清楚了你的课程，决定要趁你下课的时候跟你聊聊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>玛格丽特，请你如实告诉我，你们那天究竟聊了些什么？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>毫不掩饰的质问没有让玛格丽特的表情产生丝毫变化。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>1987年，十月下旬的某一天？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>这是个宽泛的说法。已经过去如此长的时间，我一时不能想起些什么……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>别想敷衍我，玛格丽特！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>别紧张，黑墙研究员。你想知道的问题，我都会如实地回答你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>我确实听说，在安妮逝世前，她在剑桥的日子过得并不算好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛格丽特饶有兴致地欣赏着对方的怒气，等待了足够长的时间，她才慢条斯理地再次开口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>我想起来了……十月下旬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>我确实见过安妮一次。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>那一天，路德维希教授邀请我加入拉普拉斯。在办公室外的安妮听到了我们的对话，她表现得有些反常。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>从那时起，安妮的精神状态就急转直下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>她没有交心的朋友，也没有能够信任的导师，只能自己承受一切压力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>以至于最后，发生了那样的……“意外”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>你是在暗示，因为你的离开，安妮最终选择了……结束自己的生命？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>这怎么可能？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>虽然我和安妮并不熟悉，但我知晓，她是一位信仰纯正的女性，绝无可能做出这样的举动……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>显而易见，对方正在动摇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>她祈求解脱，于你而言很难接受吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>……什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>噢，我没有别的意思。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>只是没想到，黑墙研究员，你最终会得出这样的结论。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>你究竟想暗示些什么？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>在面对玛格丽特沉静的微笑时，她却罕见地萌生退意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>算了，我不想再听你的胡言乱语——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>亲爱的组员们，外面全部布置好啦！记录仪应该已经出数据了——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>热切的呼唤声随着返回的蕾切尔传来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>——咦？你们是在吵架吗？怎么室内比室外还冷？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>黑墙有些不舒服，但已经好多了。我担心，也许是“暴雨”倒计时的原因……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>没事了。我没有时代病的症状。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>我们有应急医疗箱，有哪里不舒服记得马上告诉我——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>——啊！这是什么？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛格丽特看向蕾切尔手边的记录仪——它接收着深水测控计传回的数据。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>短时间内的巨大波动……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>外面发生了什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>蕾切尔抽出一张白纸，快速将信号转译，随后画出一幅曲线图。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>如果不是这支测控计坏了，那就是我们监测到了不得了的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她们汇总所有数据，玛格丽特写下一组高度简化的方程。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>参数代入，估算……结论使人毛骨悚然。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>这个能量值……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>简直像全球气候的“相变”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>很难不让人联想到“暴雨”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>但是这支测控计没有完成信号……怎么会这样？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>也许温度和深度的剧烈变化使数据卡在了触发位置。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>更糟糕的可能性是，它根本没有上浮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>那就很难回收测控计本体了……玛格丽特，这是你设计的测控计，你怎么看？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>它不应该脆弱到无法承受这个波动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>那、那真的是测控计本体卡在了深水位置？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>这是C023点位的测控计，我们去看看吧。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_bg_at_haidao\"><img alt=\"1_7_bg_at_haidao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png/600px-Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png/900px-Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4d/Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_bg_at_haidao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>还是看不见那个点位有浮筒。黑墙，我们的水下听音器呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>没有测控计释放装置的声音，更没有上浮的气泡声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>连接测控计的缆绳绷得很紧，我拽了，简直纹丝不动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">黑墙：</div><div>……好了，事实已经很明显了。蕾切尔，来宣布结果吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>这支检测到了异常信号的测控计，卡在了水下三十六米的位置。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>看来，我们只能放弃回收它了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛格丽特：</div><div>没事，现有的惊人数据够我们消化一阵子了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>海浪起伏，阴影笼罩，没人看清蕾切尔的表情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她只是抬手看了眼表，然后静静地眺望了一会儿海面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>黑墙研究员，玛格丽特研究员。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"648902.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"648902.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f0/HeadIconSmall-648902.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-648902.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">蕾切尔：</div><div>我决定下水回收这支测控计。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "死生对位-05"}}